    "innovation": "This paper quantifies global and Arctic effective radiative forcing using the MRI-ESM2.0 model, revealing significant but offsetting aerosol-cloud interaction effects in high-level ice clouds and identifying black carbon as the second-largest positive forcing agent in the Arctic after carbon dioxide.",
